criteria:
Inclusion criteria:
histologically confirmed cervical cancer or endometrial cancer;
planned first-time intracavitary or combined intracavitary/interstitial brachytherapy as part of the current treatment plan;
capacity to give informed consent;
sufficient German reading skills to independently understand the German-language study information and complete the questionnaire;
written consent prior to any study-related procedures.
Exclusion criteria:
lack of capacity to give consent;
previous gynaecological brachytherapy;
an acute clinical or psychological situation in which, in the doctor’s judgement, participation in the study is unreasonable;
insufficient German reading skills;
inability to complete the questionnaire, even with purely technical assistance.
